# {{NAME_TITLE}} — Dream log (consolidation history)

Written by `mh:agent:dream`. Each entry is one consolidation pass over
`memory/`. **Append-only.** Do not edit historical entries — they are the
audit trail for what was merged, dropped, promoted, or enhanced.

**Why this exists:** Sleep-time-Compute (Letta, 2025) showed ~5× compute
reduction + 13% accuracy from a periodic re-read-and-rewrite of memory.
This file is where those passes leave a trace.

**Format per entry:**

```markdown
## YYYY-MM-DD-HHMM — consolidation
- duration: Nm
- before: N entries / X lines / avg importance K.K
- after:  M entries / Y lines / avg importance K.K
- dropped (-N):
  - "<entry slug>" — reason
- merged (-N):
  - "<a>" + "<b>" → "<a>" — reason
- promoted (episodic → semantic, +N):
  - "<entry slug>" — reason
- enhanced / rescored (~N):
  - "<entry slug>" — old importance → new importance, reason
- rationale: <2-3 sentences>
```

